ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/c757e7dd1e6ea3919b111cbaed70e59f.webp?t=1614450735\" /></div><br><br></li><li>Some of the most <u>popular </u>people in the world<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/\u041f\u0443\u0442\u0438\u043d.png?t=1614450735\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/3148874df82caebe9004b5031544adac.webp?t=1614450735\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/3e4f8bac30d0b84964bd9af7341a57a7.webp?t=1614450735\" /></div></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A diverse selection of vehicles  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/abe929ba5a84bfb338f1329c59152af0.webp?t=1614450735\" /></div><br></li><li>Bonus system for in-game currency  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/0ae6b2e41b2878330bf022e100a3275d.webp?t=1614450735\" /></div><br></li><li>A soundtrack that emphasizes the style of the game  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/c757e7dd1e6ea3919b111cbaed70e59f.webp?t=1614450735\" /></div></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/74924161bf6deb1b6c0ca84ac76bd951.poster.avif?t=1614450735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517230/extras/7492416